# Sprites and generated data (apps/site/public/data/) ARE tracked so the
# GitHub Pages deploy is self-contained.
# Incremental-build stamps (source size+mtime). Advisory only — deleting it
# costs one full rebuild, nothing else.
apps/site/public/data/.build-cache.json
# The audit's findings, reports and verification scripts ARE tracked — they
# are project history, and the verify scripts are what prove the render path
# unchanged across refactors. Only its bulk artefacts are excluded.
audit/f06-rollout/
audit/f06/*.png
audit/recordings/
audit/data/

